1
00:01:08,539 --> 00:01:12,950
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:16,090
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:19,350 --> 00:01:19,880
Besides,

4
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,039
Zhao Fang and I may not be blood brothers,

5
00:01:21,810 --> 00:01:22,170
[Zhao Xiao denies ordering his brother
to commit a crime]

6
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:25,560
[Latest on the Spotlight Bar Case]

7
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,610
but all these years,

8
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,430
as his big brother,

9
00:01:25,430 --> 00:01:27,400
I haven't fulfilled
my responsibilities well.

10
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,950
I'm truly sorry for what he did.

11
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,970
How can you still smile?

12
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:35,920
Don't you know

13
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:38,520
the media will blow up
your every word and move?

14
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,640
This has nothing to do with me.

15
00:01:41,430 --> 00:01:42,830
My smile is my statement.

16
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,460
Nothing to do with you?

17
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,740
Zhao Xiao, let me tell you,

18
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:49,530
you'd better not lie to me.

19
00:01:57,310 --> 00:01:57,950
Xu Jing.

20
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,770
I have no secrets from you anymore.

21
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,800
Then tell me what really happened.

22
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:12,710
Or I can't help you even if I want to.

23
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:16,710
Okay.

24
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:19,520
Then I'll tell you.

25
00:02:20,630 --> 00:02:21,630
It's Zhao Fang.

26
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,290
He wanted to open a bar.

27
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:26,079
He had no money, so I gave him some.

28
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:29,520
What about those illegal deals out there?

29
00:02:30,910 --> 00:02:31,910
Are you involved?

30
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,430
Yes.

31
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,520
So what?

32
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,440
Zhao Fang made the contacts,

33
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,520
and he passed them on to others.

34
00:02:55,730 --> 00:02:56,820
Where's the evidence

35
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:58,400
that I ordered any of it?

36
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,100
So as a public figure,

37
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,630
you've been to the Spotlight Bar
so many times.

38
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:03,960
How do you explain that?

39
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,910
I was backing up my younger brother—

40
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:09,090
that's only natural.

41
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:11,270
And the people you bribed

42
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:13,090
who put money into your shows?

43
00:03:13,470 --> 00:03:14,730
What do you say to that?

44
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,970
The Spotlight Bar case
everyone's been watching

45
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:22,570
has taken a dramatic turn.

46
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:24,980
[Mastermind revealed:
Zhao Fang's mother, Chen Jihong]

47
00:03:22,890 --> 00:03:25,590
Zhao Xiao, once suspected
of running illegal deals,

48
00:03:25,590 --> 00:03:26,390
has been cleared.

49
00:03:26,390 --> 00:03:27,540
The mastermind behind it all

50
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:30,540
is now believed to be Zhao Fang's
mother, Chen Jihong.

51
00:03:31,650 --> 00:03:34,000
Chen Jihong has been
summoned for questioning.

52
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,630
The case proceedings are moving forward,

53
00:03:35,630 --> 00:03:38,829
and we'll continue to follow up
on further developments.

54
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,140
What are you really after?

55
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:00,040
You came to me on purpose

56
00:04:00,930 --> 00:04:02,930
and set me up with the Spotlight Bar.

57
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:06,320
Are you trying to make me a star,

58
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,150
or ruin my reputation?

59
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,810
I want to protect you.

60
00:04:18,790 --> 00:04:19,600
Xu Jing.

61
00:04:21,269 --> 00:04:24,040
I don't care why you did it.

62
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:26,630
Whatever we had

63
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:31,720
is over.

64
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:11,390
Zhao Xiao?

65
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,790
You're Zhao Xiao, right?

66
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,330
I'm Aunt Chen.

67
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,730
I don't need an aunt.

68
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:30,790
You miss your mom, don't you?

69
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,630
We've moved in.

70
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,390
From now on, I'm your new mom.

71
00:05:35,870 --> 00:05:37,190
No. You're not my mom.

72
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:40,550
Because you're already his mom.

73
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:07,600
Xiao.

74
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,350
I want to ask you a favor.

75
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:14,720
Could you give your brother some money

76
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:17,160
to start a little business?

77
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,940
Your brother is not as successful as you,

78
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,780
and he's not cut out for school.

79
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:24,390
Just call it a loan.

80
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:27,070
I'll make sure he pays you back on time.

81
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:29,070
I can put money in.

82
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,310
But I decide what business he runs.

83
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:35,050
He'll never have to worry about money.

84
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,600
I hope you're not here to comfort me.

85
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,720
Of course I'm not.

86
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:15,720
Words of comfort

87
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,930
has probably never worked on you.

88
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,600
I underestimated Zhao Xiao.

89
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:26,490
He already knows
I'm digging into the Spotlight Bar.

90
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:29,030
He won't trust me again.

91
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,790
After Zhao Xiao's scandal broke,

92
00:07:30,790 --> 00:07:32,650
Chen Jihong was pushed out front.

93
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:36,580
I thought Lin Di'er
was the one pulling his strings.

94
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:38,890
Turns out Zhao Xiao was playing dumb.

95
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:42,510
He'd set up the whole board long ago.

96
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,210
Dear viewers,

97
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:48,890
I'm reporting live.

98
00:07:49,340 --> 00:07:51,270
The Spotlight Bar scandal
everyone's been following

99
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:57,990
[Donghe Police Station,
Gucheng Branch, Yingcheng PSB]

100
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:52,530
has a new development.

101
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,920
Actor Zhao Xiao has been called in again

102
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,510
for questioning.

103
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:56,120
Zhao Xiao's coming out!

104
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,680
He's been inside four hours now.

105
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,670
Here he comes!

106
00:07:57,990 --> 00:07:59,920
[Donghe Unit]

107
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,680
Mr. Zhao!

108
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,310
I never imagined

109
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:03,000
that the mastermind behind all this

110
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,360
would be my own mother.

111
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:08,130
I know she wanted her son to succeed.

112
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:10,040
But that doesn't excuse
trampling on people's dignity

113
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,770
or crossing the line of the law.

114
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:13,770
I can't excuse what she did.

115
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,250
And I can't forgive her.

116
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:17,220
I always thought

117
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:19,750
everything she gave me
was clean and honorable.

118
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:21,000
But the truth is ugly.

119
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:23,870
To everyone who got hurt,

120
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,650
I offer my sincere apology.

121
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,400
I'm sorry.

122
00:08:38,590 --> 00:08:42,299
[Donghe Unit]

123
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:10,590
-Give it to me!
-Give it to me!

124
00:09:10,610 --> 00:09:11,980
-Give it to me!
-Give it to me!

125
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:13,630
-Give it to me!
-Give it to me!

126
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:15,320
-Give it to me!
-Give it to me!

127
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,520
Uncle Zhao gave me that race car!

128
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:22,630
Why does Zhao Xiao get to take it?

129
00:09:23,070 --> 00:09:25,070
He's Uncle Zhao's real son.

130
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:26,340
Everything here is his.

131
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:28,360
What makes you think the car is yours?

132
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,630
Did I teach you nothing?

133
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,030
You can't be this selfish.

134
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:31,860
No.

135
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:33,430
The car is mine.

136
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:34,720
And you're mine too.

137
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,270
I'm Zhao Xiao's mother first.

138
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:38,760
In this house,

139
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,600
as long as we get to eat,

140
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,150
we should be grateful.

141
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,050
Understand?

142
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:47,550
Zhao Fang,

143
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:48,930
listen to me.

144
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:51,820
Only if you obey
your brother and Uncle Zhao

145
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:53,670
am I still your mother.

146
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:56,430
Only if you do as we say

147
00:09:56,650 --> 00:09:58,300
will you survive.

148
00:09:59,320 --> 00:09:59,870
Ms. Li.

149
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,700
Is the ginseng soup ready?

150
00:10:01,750 --> 00:10:03,350
Zhao will be home any minute.

151
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,100
You did nothing wrong.

152
00:10:10,270 --> 00:10:11,720
The race car is yours,

153
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:13,950
and so is Mom.

154
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,790
But you see it now, don't you?

155
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:17,510
None of that matters.

156
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,360
Only when you're useful to others

157
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:22,410
can you get what you want.

158
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:59,640
[Agency Agreement]
